[00:00.00][by:初夏的微笑]
[00:30.61]You can see there's something in the way
[00:30.61]我们的未来充满障碍
[00:34.06]I've tried to show you, my door is open
[00:34.06]曾经我毫无保留的向你敞开心扉
[00:37.84]I don't know how much more I can take
[00:37.84]如今我脆弱的心却难以承受
[00:41.75]Since you've chosen, to leave me frozen
[00:41.75]当一切已成定局 心也化成坚冰
[00:45.26]Am I the only one, who sees what you've become?
[00:45.26]我还是见证你变化的唯一一人吗
[00:49.66]Will you drift away?
[00:49.66]你会不会与我渐行渐远
[00:53.36]We're running out of time, two wrongs can make it right
[00:53.36]时间慢慢耗尽 让我们积非成是
[00:56.95]Could I make you stay?
[00:56.95]我留不住流年可否将你留住
[01:01.01]People making choices they call vague
[01:01.01]抉择之际总是模棱两可，举棋不定
[01:08.16]Sacrifice it all and maybe say
[01:08.16]一切抛到身外 故事才有续篇
[01:15.80]Something extraordinary
[01:15.80]那些卓越无比的
[01:19.69]Something real
[01:19.69]那些真实可感的
[01:23.30]To fill my days and nights with something that I can feel
[01:23.30]填补了我无数个苍白日夜的感情
[01:31.24]I'm not gonna compromise
[01:31.24]我绝不妥协
[01:35.21]Surely you can sympathize
[01:35.21]我们心中仍可产生共鸣
[01:38.76]Say you feel the same
[01:38.76]告诉我，其实你也感同身受
[01:46.38]You've wandered down a path I can't explain
[01:46.38]你踏上一条我难以理解的路途
[01:49.98]Have you seen her, the grass is greener
[01:49.98]邻家芳草绿 你是否已遇见你的命中注定
[01:53.53]To let me pass you by would be a shame
[01:53.53]与你擦肩而过，是我此生之憾
[01:57.29]If she's your only , then why you lonely?
[01:57.29]若她不可代替，那你又为何孤寂无依
[02:01.48]Cos I'm the only one, who know the things you've done
[02:01.48]只因我与你才是天生一对，知晓你的点点滴滴
[02:05.30]I'm so good for you
[02:05.30]我们在一起是如此合适
[02:08.96]We're running out of time, two wrongs can make it right
