[02:39.12]Say you feel the same
[02:39.12]告诉我，其实你也感同身受
[02:46.77]Just don't say it will be alright
[02:46.77]别说什么纵然身处风雷雨 坚信朝阳必再遇
[02:50.21]I'm not holding yourself in your arms tonight
